<title>UK: Cazenove Indian GDR Index down 1.84 percent.</title>
<headline>Cazenove Indian GDR Index down 1.84 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cazenove Indian GDR Index fell 1.27 points, 1.84 percent, to 76.34 after the Bombay Stock Exchange 30 share index fell 33.53 points to 3,422.34.</p>
<p>The premium for GDRs over stocks on the local market was 12.28 percent.</p>
<p>The Cazenove index is a capitalisation weighted basket of Indian global depositary receipts and measures the change from midday on the previous trading day to midday today.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 5887</p>
